    "description": "Retro Worlds - Mario/Sonic/Zelda [Customizable]\r\n\r\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/lja52Fs.gif[/img]\r\n\r\n🖥️ 1920X1080 \r\n🎵 Audio Responsive\r\n\r\nSprites Mario & Luigi by : HugoSanchez2000\r\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/hugosanchez2000/gallery?q=idle\r\n_________________________________\r\n\r\nAll 3 worlds are customizables and several clickable sound effects are in each of them:\r\n\r\n🍄👲🏻🏰 MARIO WORLD:\r\n\r\nChange :\r\n -Mario or Fire Mario\r\n -Powerup (Fire flower or Mushroom\r\nLeave:\r\n -Title Logo      -Koopa\r\n -Luigi               - Goomba (right)        \r\n -Lakitu             -Coins\r\nAdd : \r\n -Bowser\r\n -Audio Bars\r\n\r\nSFX : Mario - Luigi - Title Logo - Powerup - Coins - Yoshi\r\n\r\n⚡🦔💎 SONIC WORLD:\r\n\r\nChange :\r\n -Sonic or Super Sonic\r\nLeave:\r\n  -Title Logo      -Eggman\r\nAdd:\r\n -Audio Bars\r\n\r\nSFX : Sonic - Tails - Title Logo \r\n\r\n🧝🗡️🏹 ZELDA WORLD:\r\n\r\nLeave:\r\n  -Title Logo         - HUD\r\n  -Green Bird       - Blue Bird        \r\n  -Triforce\r\nAdd :\r\n -Audio Bars\r\n\r\nSFX : Link - Navi - Title Logo - Health bar - Rupee - Triforce\r\n___________________________\r\nAdd  : \r\n -VHS Effect \r\n -Clock\r\n___________________________\r\n🎵 30 BGMS Mario/Sonic/Zelda :\r\nYou can choose BGMS from a single world or all 3 mixed together.\r\n\r\nMario : \r\n -SMB (NES) Overworld - SMB2 Overworld - SMB3 Athletic\r\n -SMLand World 1-1 - SMSunshine Delfino Plaza - Yoshi Island Flower Garden\r\n -SMW athletic - SM64 Bob-Omb battlefield - SM3D Super Bell Hill\r\n -NSBM Overworld\r\n\r\nSonic\r\n -Green Hill - Emerald Hill - Chemical Plant\r\n -Heroes Seaside Hill - Escape From the City (intrumental) - Unleash Windmill-isle-day\r\n -Lost World Wonder World - Lost World Windy Hill - Generation Rooftop Run  Classic - Generation Rooftop Run  Modern\r\n\r\nZelda :\r\n - Zelda Main Theme - SS Zelda's Lullaby - OT Great Fairys Fountain\r\n - OT Shop - OT Inside the house - OT Song of Storms\r\n -OT Lost Woods - OT Kokiri Forest - Kakariko Forest \r\n -OT Kaepora Gaebora\r\n____________________________________\r\n\r\n[h1]DISCLAIMER[/h1]\r\nI do not own any artwork , I only do the animations. If the source is missing and you know who it is, please write a comment with the artist's name\r\n\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\n[url=https://ko-fi.com/themanofsteel] [img]https://i.imgur.com/RtOPVLd.png[/img] [/url]\r\n\r\n[url=https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=YPPCFP99K9R6E] [img]https://i.imgur.com/tVgae8D.png[/img] [/url]",
